<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIA AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIA AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania and Netherlands were</p>
<p>level</p>
<p>2-2 after the first reverse singles in their Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>world group first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result (Romanian name first)</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea lost to Jan Siemerink  6-7 (6-8) 7-5 7-6 (7-3) 6-7</p>
<p>(8-10) 4-6</p>
